<title>BRAZIL: Banco do Brasil March net 30.3 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Banco do Brasil March net 30.3 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian government bank Banco do Brasil showed a net profit of 30.344 million reais in March or 0.04 reais per 1,000 shares, the bank said in a statement sent to the stock exchanges.</p>
<p>In the first quarter of the year, Banco do Brasil reported a net profit of 80.953 million reais, it added.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
